    objective: 'Avoid accumulating points. The player with the lowest total score after 7 deals wins; the player with the highest score is the loser.',
    gameplay: '1. Matching: Play proceeds counter-clockwise. Tiles are played in a single line, matching the pips on the exposed ends.\n2. Going Out: A deal ends when a player plays their last tile.\n3. Scoring: When a player goes out, all other players sum the pips on their remaining tiles and add them to their cumulative score.',
